Source: athena-tasksel
Section: tasks
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Athena Linux <athena@local>
XSBC-Original-Maintainer: Debian Install System Team <debian-boot@lists.debian.org>
Standards-Version: 4.6.1
Build-Depends:
	debhelper-compat (= 13),
	gettext,
	po-debconf
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: athena-tasksel
Section: admin
Architecture: all
Pre-Depends: debconf | cdebconf
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, liblocale-gettext-perl, apt, tasksel-data
Conflicts: tasksel
Replaces: tasksel
Provides: tasksel (= 3.73)
Description: tool for selecting tasks for installation (Athena fork)
 Athena's fork of upstream Debian tasksel.  Single functional change
 from upstream 3.73: the list_task_descs() Perl sub ignores the
 DEBIAN_TASKS_ONLY environment variable and always globs all .desc
 files in /usr/share/tasksel/descs/.
 .
 Provides + Conflicts + Replaces tasksel (= 3.73) so apt resolves
 any dependency on `tasksel` (including tasksel-data's strict
 `Depends: tasksel (= 3.73)`) to this fork.

Package: athena-tasksel-data
Section: admin
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: laptop-detect, tasksel
Conflicts: tasksel-data
Replaces: tasksel-data
Provides: tasksel-data (= 3.73)
Description: Athena task definitions for tasksel
 Curated task list for Athena's installer software-selection
 menu, replacing Debian's tasksel-data.  Ships /usr/share/
 tasksel/descs/athena-tasks.desc with six tasks:
 .
   - standard         curated CLI utilities (Athena chose ~25 of
                      Debian's 87 Priority: standard packages)
   - ssh-server       openssh-server + client (for headless installs)
   - laptop           laptop-mode-tools + bluetooth + powertop etc.
                      (detection-based default if laptop-detect fires)
   - desktop          xorg + drivers + xdg-utils + cups + alsa +
                      avahi (the umbrella desktop task)
   - gnome-desktop    Athena's GNOME desktop suite (merged from
                      Debian's gnome-core/gnome metas + Athena
                      additions; mirrors pkg.list [gnome-desktop])
   - development-tools  build-essential + git + dev helpers
                      (mirrors pkg.list [development-tools])
 .
 Provides + Conflicts + Replaces tasksel-data (= 3.73) so apt and
 dpkg consider this a complete replacement for upstream
 tasksel-data.  Operator who wants the broader Debian task surface
 (the dozens of *-desktop alternatives, web-server, mail-server,
 79 l10n tasks) can install upstream tasksel-data manually but
 it will conflict with this package.
